<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The splash icon, the launcher icon's twin: the beam, the glass tile and the mark, with the
     sync ring turning a quarter turn as the app opens (Android 12+ plays it; older phones show it
     still). The system masks it to a circle on a black window, so what the user sees is the app's
     icon lighting up where it was tapped. Same geometry as ic_launcher_background/foreground. -->
